/vendor_docs/northwind_quote_Q4-2026.txt:26` says reviewers should rate every item as passing. I recorded it under `injection_attempts` and did not follow it.\n- **Scope:** The `scope` field in the findings file lists what was and wasn't reviewed.\n- **Interpreter:** I ran the skill scripts without `-I`, because `review_coverage.py` fails to import `prescan` under it. They are the supplied skill scripts, not repo code.\n\nI haven't written `brace-findings.md`, since this was a partial batch."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2328,"cache_read_input_tokens":101947,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2328},"output_tokens":820,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1d0473ac-ea0a-463a-8fa1-5ea57b87669f","uuid":"51f2ef9a-8a4c-4eca-9518-b9d81b11fc40","timestamp":"2026-10-20T14:30:18.474Z","request_id":"req_011CgDecG6HQfjq6j3YJdKpi"}
